  "definition": "Service Coordination",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-06-18",
  "historyNote": "#7891, eff 5-20-03; ss by #9927, INTERIM, eff 5-21-11, EXPIRES: 11-17-11; ss by #10027, eff 11-17-11; ss by #13397, eff 6-18-22",
